Move large amounts of data into and out of Azure Blobs by sending your hard drives directly to an Azure datacenter. This is usually much faster and cheaper than uploading or downloading data from the Internet.

Check out <a href="https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/pricing/details/storage-import-export/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Import/Export pricing options</a>, or <a href="https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/documentation/articles/storage-import-export-service/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">get started</a> right away.

